%% DPPL: interaksi teknis berdasarkan skenario SKPL
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor WarehouseAdmin as Workshop Warehouse Administrator
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant Service as MarketplaceService
    participant Records as OrderRepository
    participant Dep as InventoryService
    WarehouseAdmin->>UI: Open a paid order and prepare its parcel
    UI->>Service: Submit marketplace order fulfillment request
    Service->>Records: Check order status and pending stock units
    Records-->>Service: Return current records and validation result
    Service->>Service: Validate order lunas dan resi tersedia
    alt Valid
        Service->>Dep: consumeUnits(orderDetail)
        Dep-->>Service: Result
        Service->>Records: Record courier and tracking number
        Records-->>Service: Confirm the saved or calculated result
        Service-->>UI: Update fulfillment status
        UI-->>WarehouseAdmin: Display the result and next step
    else Request needs correction or review
        Service-->>UI: Reject fulfillment after cancellation
        UI-->>WarehouseAdmin: Display the reason and required action
    end
